<section id="process">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2 class="sec-title">How a project <em>works</em></h2>
		<p class="sec-lede">Four steps, from the first message to the live site.</p>
		<div class="timeline" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b class="runner"></b></div>
		<div class="steps">
			<div class="step">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 10h24v14H18l-6 6v-6H6z"></path><g class="i-typing"><circle cx="12.5" cy="17" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="17" r="1.7"></circle><circle cx="23.5" cy="17" r="1.7"></circle></g><path class="i-pop" d="M34 20h8v10h-4v5l-6-5h-8"></path></svg>
				<span class="snum">01</span>
				<h3>Talk it through</h3>
				<span class="stag">A short conversation</span>
				<p>What the business does, who the website is for, and the material you already have. A short email or WhatsApp message is enough to start.</p>
