				<span class="snum">02</span>
				<h3>Proposal</h3>
				<span class="stag">In writing before work starts</span>
				<p>The page list, content needs, timeline and price, agreed before any work begins.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="8" width="36" height="30" rx="2"></rect><path d="M6 15h36"></path><circle class="i-dot" cx="10.5" cy="11.5" r="1.1"></circle><circle class="i-dot" cx="14.5" cy="11.5" r="1.1"></circle><rect class="i-block" x="11" y="21" width="14" height="10"></rect><path class="i-ln" style="--k:0" d="M28 22h9"></path><path class="i-ln" style="--k:1" d="M28 27h9"></path><path class="i-ln" style="--k:2" d="M28 32h6"></path></svg>
				<span class="snum">03</span>
				<h3>Design and build</h3>
				<span class="stag">Design first, then the build</span>
				<p>You review the design first, then the working site, before anything goes live.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="i-ring" cx="24" cy="22" r="14"></circle><circle class="i-ring i-ring-b" cx="24" cy="22" r="14"></circle><circle cx="24" cy="22" r="14"></circle><path class="i-check" d="M18 22l4 4 8-8"></path><path d="M10 42h28"></path></svg>
				<span class="snum">04</span>
				<h3>Launch</h3>
				<span class="stag">Checked at launch</span>
